 "scope": "Declared adjacent endpoint/interior S3 combination and ordinary L1<p fixed-profile family; nonzero-pivot adaptive count excludes and retains its original zero branch.",
 "statement": "Distinct-generator b-elimination package:20 generic laws and5 symbolic applications compile; canonical local all-tracked audit389/0/0. Exact S3 clearing/cancellation, retained-original/zero branches, primitive denominator/scaling identities and conditional min-weight/finite-cover cost laws are formal. Ordinary universal two-chart coverage has linear-in-p cost under the stated profile/card premises. Three coefficient anchors, adaptive rank-one search and a uniform-b nonzero-pivot count are hand analysis; the exceptional branch retains original F2. No all-adaptive impossibility, useful-yield, numerical execution or complete subexponential ECDLP algorithm claim."
